desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Poetry Missing Solver Min Release Age"
	title_zh: "检测到Poetry Missing Solver Min Release Age",
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-insecure-api-poetry-missing-solver-min-release-age"
	risk: "Security"
	desc: <<<DESC
Migrated from Semgrep rule `poetry-missing-solver-min-release-age` (/tmp/semgrep-rules/package_managers/poetry/poetry-missing-solver-min-release-age.yaml).
Original message: This poetry.toml does not set a dependency cooldown via `solver.min-release-age`. Without a cooldown, Poetry may resolve newly published package versions that have not yet been vetted by the community. Supply chain attacks frequently involve publishing a malicious version of a popular package and waiting for it to be pulled in — most are detected and removed within days. Set `min-release-age = 7` under `[solver]` to require that package versions are at least 7 days old before they are considered during dependency resolution. Added in: v2.4.0

CWE: CWE-829: Inclusion of Functionality from Untrusted Control Sphere
References:
- https://python-poetry.org/docs/configuration/#solvermin-release-age
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
Review the flagged code and follow the framework's secure coding guidance: use safe APIs, escape output, and avoid hardcoded credentials.
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos/poetry.toml": <<<POS
[solver]
1
Q=2@L D
Vk[X[Be- g"CNVZ
 L6um,A5;+(P&$"b V(
(
 kKc
---

POS
	"safefile://neg.sample": <<<NEG
# safe sample
no secrets here
just regular code
NEG
)

${/.*\/poetry\.toml/}.pattern_regex(/(?m)^\[solver\]\n(?:^(?!min-release-age|\[|---).*\n)*(?=^\[|^---|\z)/) as $p0
${/.*\/poetry\.toml/}.pattern_regex(/(?ms)^\[solver\](?:[^\[]*?)min-release-age\s*=\s*(?P<TARGET>"[^"]*"|[0-6](?:\s|#|$)|false)/) as $p1
${/.*\/config\.toml/}.pattern_regex(/(?m)^\[solver\]\n(?:^(?!min-release-age|\[|---).*\n)*(?=^\[|^---|\z)/) as $p2
${/.*\/config\.toml/}.pattern_regex(/(?ms)^\[solver\](?:[^\[]*?)min-release-age\s*=\s*(?P<TARGET>"[^"]*"|[0-6](?:\s|#|$)|false)/) as $p3
$p0 + $p1 + $p2 + $p3 as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Poetry Missing Solver Min Release Age",
	title_zh: "检测到Poetry Missing Solver Min Release Age",
	message: "Poetry Missing Solver Min Release Age",
}
